{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/716089-skills-sidereals-and-astrology","id":716089,"title":"Skills, Sidereals, and Astrology.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-22T16:28:51-07:00","id":716089,"title":"Skills, Sidereals, and Astrology.","content":"Ex3 has revised the skill list so that there are now 40 skills, 8 per Solar Caste. I'm assuming that Dragon-Blooded, Abyssal, and Sidereal will follow suit (almost literally where the Abyssals are concerned). Where the Sidereals are concerned, each skill has been associated with a constellation in Creation's sky in both prior editions. <br /> <br /> Did the night sky of Creation just get a lot more crowded?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T16:30:00-07:00","id":716106,"title":"","content":"Wait, what? There are 15 completely new Abilities added to the system? That can't be what you mean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 10-22-2015, 07:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T16:33:07-07:00","id":716144,"title":"","content":"Oops; sorry, no there aren't. There's a lot of overlap among the Castes; I'll get back to you on what each Caste's skills are.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Dawn:</b> Archery, <i>Awareness</i>, Brawl (and Martial Arts), <i>Dodge</i>, Melee, <i>Resistance</i>, Thrown, <i>War</i><br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Zenith:</b> <i>Athletics</i>, <i>Integrity</i>, Performance, <i>Lore</i>, <i>Presence</i>, <i>Resistance</i>, Survival, <i>War</i><br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Twilight:</b> <i>Bureaucracy</i>, Craft, <i>Integrity</i>, <i>Investigation</i>, <i>Linguistics</i>, <i>Lore</i>, Medicine, <i>Occult</i><br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Night:</b> <i>Athletics</i>, <i>Awareness</i>, <i>Dodge</i>, <i>Investigation</i>, <i>Larceny</i>, <i>Ride</i>, Stealth, <i>Socialize</i><br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Eclipse:</b> <i>Bureaucracy</i>, <i>Larceny</i>, <i>Linguistics</i>, <i>Occult</i>, <i>Presence</i>, <i>Ride</i>, Sail, <i>Socialize</i><br /> <br /> Italicized skills appear in multiple Castes. AFAICT, no skill appears in three Castes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 10-22-2015, 07:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T16:39:55-07:00","id":716163,"title":"","content":"Yeah that makes more sense. Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13