orum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/716089-skills-sidereals-and-astrology?p=716168#post716168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We are at 26 Abilities now, though. That will affect the Sids.</div> </div> </div> </div>Chosen of Endings lose Martial Arts, but keep the Constellation of the Sword.<br /> <br /> The Sword probably becomes the new home of Sidereal Presence, which needed a bunch of new Charms anyway since so many went to Battles/Banner/War.<br /> <br /> Violet Bier of Sorrows becomes just another Magical Martial Arts Style which happens to be based on Saturn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T09:45:08-07:00","id":723406,"title":"","content":"I'd rather Endings get Brawl. Part of my image of them is as the best of the best martial artists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T09:51:06-07:00","id":723417,"title":"","content":"I remember Vance saying he would eat his hat if Athletics didn't return to Endings, which would allow Brawl to fit into Battles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T10:04:25-07:00","id":723437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cogliostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/716089-skills-sidereals-and-astrology?p=716168#post716168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We are at 26 Abilities now, though. That will affect the Sids.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. Martial Arts as effectively a specialized aspect of Brawl, and a character can't have it without having a dot of Brawl.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T10:09:19-07:00","id":723446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/716089-skills-sidereals-and-astrology?p=723406#post723406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd rather Endings get Brawl. Part of my image of them is as the best of the best martial artists.</div> </div> </div> </div>But that means taking Brawl away from the Gauntlet again. And turning all of the Mars-flavored Brawling Charms into Saturn-flavored ones.<br /> <br /> My solution involves abandoning nothing and creating the least number of new-fangled things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T10:12:06-07:00","id":723475,"title":"","content":"I liked the solution of folding the Mars-Flavored Brawling charms into Crimson Panoply of Victory Style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T11:11:04-07:00","id":723681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/716089-skills-sidereals-and-astrology?p=723475#post723475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I liked the solution of folding the Mars-Flavored Brawling charms into Crimson Panoply of Victory Style.</div> </div> </div> </div>And what will you make to replace them?<br /> <br /> Don't think that Violet Bier of Sorrows Style will be Brawl Charms!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T12:01:03-07:00","id":723856,"title":"","content":"Hopefully Sidereal Brawl will be Throne Shadow! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T12:16:39-07:00","id":723915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/716089-skills-sidereals-and-astrology?p=723856#post723856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hopefully Sidereal Brawl will be Throne Shadow! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Hopefully Throne Shadow will continue to be a Style.<br /> <br /> Hero Styles don't exist anymore. Why would Sidereal Brawl have a Form Charm?<br /> <br /> Violet Bier of Sorrows had a Form Charm because it was always a Style. Even in First Edition, it didn't make sense to treat it like native Charms, because Solars and Terrestrials didn't get anything like that. They were published with Snake Style and Five Dragon Style, which anyone could learn.<br /> <br /> Heck, anyone could learn Violet Bier of Sorrows in both previous Editions, and they'll continue to do so in this new Edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T13:05:22-07:00","id":724039,"title":"","content":"The Chosen of Endings are not about fighting. They are not the fighting-oriented Caste of the Sidereals. That is Battles, in as much as even Battles Sidereals are meant to actually <i>personally</i> fight as opposed to <i>arranging</i> fights.<br /> <br /> To the extent that the Endings are about dealing death, they might be the assassins to the warriors of the Battles Caste, in that they are more focused on the <i>result</i> of a target dying than on winning fights or wars which cause people to die. People can die very easily from chicken bones, disease, falling down stairs, fires, and angry bosses or lynch mobs.<br /> <br /> Martial Arts is not inherently more about assassination than it is about brawling, tactical fisticuffs, or formalized duels. Even Violet Bier of Sorrows is less about assassination and more about kicking ass. Assassination need not involve combat at all, especially through the use of poisons or traps.<br /> <br /> Saturn's Sword is not an expression of Saturn's personal combat prowess; the Sword of Saturn is the Sword of Damocles, the representation of the Inevitable End, of the moment when Saturn strikes the thread of your destiny from the Loom of Fate. It is not the dueling sword, but the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Executioner%27s_sword\" target=\"_blank\">Executioner's Sword</a>. It might as well be an Axe for that reason, but it could also be an assassin's dagger, a surgeon's scalpel, or a tailor's scissors.<br /> <br /> Given all of that, and given that every Chosen of Endings is one Favored Ability away from favoring Brawl/Martial Arts as much as any Chosen of Battles, is there REALLY a problem with moving Brawl back where it needs to be?<br /> <br /> Assuming that Sidereal Castes don't get an expanded number of Caste Abilities to choose from, like Solars did, and the Sidereals WON'T get to choose a Supernal Ability.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 10-24-2015, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T14:05:45-07:00","id":724117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/716089-skills-sidereals-and-astrology?p=723417#post723417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember Vance saying he would eat his hat if Athletics didn't return to Endings, which would allow Brawl to fit into Battles.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is entirely possible that I may still eat my hat\u2014not without a fight, but still, possible. Such is the plight of a mere writer!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T14:14:17-07:00","id":724125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/716089-skills-sidereals-and-astrology?p=724117#post724117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is entirely possible that I may still eat my hat\u2014not without a fight, but still, possible. Such is the plight of a mere writer!</div> </div> </div> </div>It boggles me that Athletics was made the Banner instead of War.<br /> <br /> War. War banners. Battle standards, signal flags, pennants... commanding and inspiring armies... It's the natural fit!<br /> <br /> Not to mention that the Banner used to be Presence, which had all those Presence Charms which became War Charms and left basically nothing for Presence, which would have easily let the developers move Presence to a new Constellation and Caste!<br /> <br /> Like the Sword of Endings.<br /> <br /> Athletics was FINE where it was.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T14:24:28-07:00","id":724134,"title":"","content":"Plus, let me mention an old, old argument.<br /> <br /> MARtial Arts.<br /> <br /> As in, the Arts of Mars, deity of WAR and FIGHTING.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}